r co-op as you delve in the dungeons.**\n\n- Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed melee weapons, bows, shields, and powerful spells\n\n**Master a physics-based combat system. Slash, bash, and dismember with style**\n{693808796750877}\n{1436682780702563}\n\n**Team up in 3-player co-op to conquer the dungeons together**\n{1051661560445750}\n\n**Combine spellcasting with melee or ranged attacks to suit your style**\n{1355108305574031}\n\n**Return to the social hub to craft gear, talk about your adventures, and prepare for your next dungeon**\n{1245137219848273}\n\n\n", "short_description": "One More Delve is an intense, physics-driven dungeon crawler adventure. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve in the dungeons.\n\n- Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed melee weapons, bows, shields, and powerful spells\n- Master a physics-based combat system. Slash, bash, and dismember with style\n- Team up in 3-player co-op to conquer the dungeons together\n- Return to the social hub to craft gear, talk about your adventures, and prepare for your next dungeon"}]}, "developer_name": "ATVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/W1zurd/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy/blob/main/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ATVR", "support_website_url": "https://discord.com/invite/GC4CqRebvF", "website_url": "https://github.com/W1zurd/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy/blob/main/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy.txt", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_pr